---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import iconImg from '../assets/icon.png';

const lastUpdated = 'June 18, 2026';
const contactEmail = 'nagaraj.limica@gmail.com';

// Shared utility strings for the legal prose
const h2 = 'text-[22px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink mt-[38px] mb-3';
const p = 'text-base leading-[1.7] text-[#3C4350] mb-3.5';
const ul = 'list-disc pl-[22px] mb-3.5';
const li = 'text-base leading-[1.7] text-[#3C4350] mb-2';
const link = 'text-brand-strong font-semibold underline underline-offset-2';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Stock Master"
  description="How Stock Master handles your data. We do not collect personal information; ads are served by Google. Read the full privacy policy."
>
  <div class="bg-surface min-h-screen">
    <!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-surface/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-line">
      <nav
        class="mx-auto max-w-[880px] px-8 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-6 max-[560px]:px-5"
      >
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-[11px] no-underline">
          <Picture
            src={iconImg}
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            pictureAttributes={{ class: 'contents' }}
            alt="Stock Master"
            widths={[34, 68]}
            sizes="34px"
            class="w-[34px] h-[34px] rounded-[10px] shrink-0"
          />
          <span class="font-extrabold text-[19px] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">Stock Master</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink-soft no-underline">← Back to home</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- ============ POLICY ============ -->
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-[880px] px-8 pt-16 pb-10 max-[560px]:px-5">
      <div class="text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-brand mb-[14px]">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="font-extrabold text-[44px] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-3.5">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <!-- Summary card -->
      <div class="mt-8 bg-tint border border-[#D5E3FF] rounded-[18px] px-[26px] py-6">
        <div class="text-[13px] font-bold text-brand-strong mb-2.5">The short version</div>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#3C4350]">
          Stock Master is an educational stock-market app.
          <strong class="text-ink"
            >We don't ask you to sign up, and we don't collect, store, or sell your personal
            information.</strong
          > The app is supported by ads served through Google, and Google may collect limited data (such
          as your device's advertising identifier) to show those ads. You can limit or reset that at any
          time from your device settings.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article class="mt-2">
        <h2 class={h2}>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          Stock Master (“the app”, “we”, “us”) is an educational application for learning about the
          stock market — it provides trading calculators, a library of investing books, and Pulse
          market insights. This Privacy Policy explains how the app handles information when you use
          it. It applies to the Stock Master mobile app and this website.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2}>2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          <strong class="text-ink">We do not collect personal information.</strong> Stock Master does
          not require an account, login, or registration. We do not ask for your name, email address,
          phone number, or financial details, and we do not maintain user profiles or a server-side
          database of your activity.
        </p>
        <p class={p}>
          Any settings or values you enter into the calculators are processed on your device for the
          purpose of showing you a result. They are not transmitted to us.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2}>3. Advertising (Google)</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          The app is free and is supported by advertising delivered through Google (for example,
          Google AdMob). To serve and measure ads, Google and its partners may collect and process
          certain information from your device, which can include:
        </p>
        <ul class={ul}>
          <li class={li}>your device's advertising identifier (e.g. Google Advertising ID);</li>
          <li class={li}>general device and app information (device model, operating system, app version);</li>
          <li class={li}>approximate location derived from your IP address; and</li>
          <li class={li}>data about how ads are viewed or interacted with.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class={p}>
          This collection is carried out by Google under its own privacy policy, not by us. We do not
          receive your personal information through these ads. To understand how Google uses this
          data, see
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class={link}
            >Google's Privacy Policy</a
          >
          and
          <a
            href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class={link}>How Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services</a
          >.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2}>4. Your choices</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          You can control ad personalization and your advertising identifier directly on your device:
        </p>
        <ul class={ul}>
          <li class={li}>
            <strong class="text-ink">Android:</strong> Settings → Google → Ads, where you can reset your
            advertising ID or opt out of ad personalization.
          </li>
          <li class={li}>
            <strong class="text-ink">iOS:</strong> Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Tracking and → Apple
            Advertising.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class={h2}>5. Links to other services</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          The app and this site link to third-party websites — for example, book pages on Amazon.
          When you follow those links, the destination site's own privacy policy applies. We are not
          responsible for the content or privacy practices of other services.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2}>6. Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          Stock Master is intended for a general audience interested in financial education. We do
          not knowingly collect personal information from children. Because we do not collect
          personal information at all, the app does not build profiles of any user, including
          children.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2}>7. Data security</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          Because we do not collect or store your personal information on our servers, there is no
          personal data held by us that could be exposed. Information handled by Google for
          advertising is protected under Google's own security practices.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2}>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time — for example, if advertising providers
          or app features change. When we do, we will revise the “Last updated” date above. We
          encourage you to review this page periodically.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2}>9. Contact us</h2>
        <p class={p}>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at
          <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`} class={link}>{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>

        <!-- Disclaimer (prominent, SEBI norms) -->
        <div class="mt-12 bg-tint border border-[#D5E3FF] rounded-[18px] px-[26px] py-6">
          <h2 class="text-[22px] font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink mb-3">Disclaimer</h2>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-[#3C4350] mb-3.5">
            Stock Master is an educational tool. Its calculators, books, and insights are for
            learning purposes only and are not financial, investment, or trading advice. Investing
            in securities involves risk.
          </p>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-[#3C4350]">
            <strong class="text-ink">As per SEBI norms:</strong> Equity investments are subject to
            100% market risks. Refer to your financial consultant's advice before investing. This
            group is only for educational, learning and knowledge purposes. Admins have no
            responsibility for your intended decisions and financial losses. Keep calculated and
            always analyse your cash position and risk-bearing capacity before following any messages
            or postings from our group. We do not provide any buy, sell, or hold recommendations,
            either directly or indirectly. This channel does not offer stock tips, signals, or
            personalized advice.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>

    <!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->
    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>
